  "citation": "Steurer P M; Karl T R (2018): Historical Sunshine and Cloud Data in the United States (revised 1991) (NDP-021). Carbon Dioxide Informational Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/CLI.NDP021",
